{"id":"feadf4573b522982","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-self-similar.md","title":"Self-Similar","display":"df-self-similar — Self-Similar","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-self-similar","aliases":["58-df-self-similar","Self-Similar"],"display":"df-self-similar — Self-Similar","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-compact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-self-similar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-self-similar</span><span>Self-Similar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-self-similar — Self-Similar"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"58-df-metric-space\">58-df-metric-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,d)\">\\((X,d)\\)</span> (metric space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (finite nonempty family of self-maps of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X\">\\(S\\subseteq X\\)</span> (nonempty compact candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:F\\to(0,1)\">\\(r:F\\to(0,1)\\)</span> (similarity-ratio function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d\">\\(\\tau_d\\)</span> (topology induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\)</span> (metric-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"58-df-metric-space\">58-df-metric-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S,\\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S,\\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenSetCondition}_S,\\mathrm{SimilarityDimension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenSetCondition}_S,\\mathrm{SimilarityDimension}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,F,(0,1))\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,X)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(f(x),f(y))=r(f)d(x,y))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,F,(0,1))\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,X)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(f(x),f(y))=r(f)d(x,y))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}metric\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}metric\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S(S,F,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\land S\\ne\\emptyset\\land S\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(S,\\{U\\cap S:U\\in\\tau_d\\}\\right)\\land S=\\bigcup_{f\\in F}f[S]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S(S,F,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\land S\\ne\\emptyset\\land S\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(S,\\{U\\cap S:U\\in\\tau_d\\}\\right)\\land S=\\bigcup_{f\\in F}f[S]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}open\\text{-}set\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenSetCondition}_S(F,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in(0,1)^F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau_d\\;\\bigl(U\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;(f[U]\\subseteq U)\\land\\forall f,g\\in F\\;(f\\ne g\\to f[U]\\cap g[U]=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}open\\text{-}set\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenSetCondition}_S(F,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in(0,1)^F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau_d\\;\\bigl(U\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;(f[U]\\subseteq U)\\land\\forall f,g\\in F\\;(f\\ne g\\to f[U]\\cap g[U]=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}dimension} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimilarityDimension}_S(s,F,r)\\leftrightarrow s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,F,(0,1))\\land\\sum_{f\\in F}r(f)^s=1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}dimension} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimilarityDimension}_S(s,F,r)\\leftrightarrow s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,F,(0,1))\\land\\sum_{f\\in F}r(f)^s=1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-similar here means invariant under a finite family of strict similarities, with the ambient metric and the family recorded explicitly.</li>\n<li>On a complete metric space the Hutchinson operator has a unique nonempty compact fixed set.</li>\n<li>Equality of similarity and Hausdorff dimensions requires the open set condition; it is a theorem, not part of the definition of similarity dimension.</li>\n<li>Sierpinski: three contractions of ratio 1/2 give standard Sierpinski triangle</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Falconer, Fractal Geometry</li>\n<li>Hutchinson, Fractals and Self-Similarity</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)$ (metric-space predicate, see [[58-df-metric-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}(F)$ (finite-set predicate, see [[58-df-finite]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S$ (compact-space predicate from [[58-df-compact]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"r:F\\to(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S,\\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenSetCondition}_S,\\mathrm{SimilarityDimension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,F,(0,1))\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,X)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(f(x),f(y))=r(f)d(x,y))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}metric\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\tau_d\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S(S,F,r,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\land S\\ne\\emptyset\\land S\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(S,\\{U\\cap S:U\\in\\tau_d\\}\\right)\\land S=\\bigcup_{f\\in F}f[S]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}open\\text{-}set\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenSetCondition}_S(F,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in(0,1)^F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SimilarityIFS}_S(F,r,X,d)\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau_d\\;\\bigl(U\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;(f[U]\\subseteq U)\\land\\forall f,g\\in F\\;(f\\ne g\\to f[U]\\cap g[U]=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}similar\\text{-}dimension} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimilarityDimension}_S(s,F,r)\\leftrightarrow s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,F,(0,1))\\land\\sum_{f\\in F}r(f)^s=1","display":true}],"bytes":2970,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a7cb731de9f9107","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SelfSimilar}_S(F,\\Psi,r,X,d_X)$ (see [[58-df-self-similar]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-self-similar.md|58-df-self-similar]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}